Cua Driver 0.28.2
=================

Maka's macOS binary packages include the Cua Driver executable at
Contents/Resources/bin/cua-driver. Its source is
https://github.com/trycua/cua/tree/fc188250b4ca8549b8e61f937fdb1fb560770e86/libs/cua-driver/rust
and it is licensed as follows:

